  Slug: school-of-magical-technologies
  DisplayName: School of Magical Technologies
  IconPath: icons/commodities/tech/cog-brass.webp
  Description: "At the height of ancient Azlant, the study of magical technologies\u2014better
    known as magitech\u2014was considered among the most prestigious of arcane specializations,
    and practitioners were both well regarded and well paid. While some magitech
    specialists trained in academies or as apprentices, others studied at religious
    cloisters dedicated to the worship of Amaznen, a now-dead god of invention and
    magic. Today, practitioners are more likely to learn from scraps of ancient spellbooks,
    forgotten lore unearthed in Azlanti ruins, or from a time-displaced graduate
    like Anoreth Zorillen. Modern magitech schools exist today, divorced from their
    ancient Azlanti origins but no less prestigious, including the famed Clockwork
    Cathedral in Absalom and temples of Brigh, goddess of clockwork and invention.
    As a student of magical technologies, you've learned the art of fusing magic
    with mundane technology to create something truly unique. Curriculum cantrips:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Needle Darts], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Shield]
    1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mending], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Runic
    Weapon], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Summon Construct] 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Animated
    Assault], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dismantle] 3rd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Shrink
    Item], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wooden Double] 4th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Creation],
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Weapon Storm] 5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Impaling
    Spike], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall of Stone] 6th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Field
    of Razors], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Petrify] 7th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Beheading
    Buzz Saw], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Lifewood Cage] 8th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ferrous
    Form], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Quandary] 9th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Resplendent
    Mansion] School Spells initial: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Augmented
    Body] advanced: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Conjured Clockwork]"
